{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/\u110b\u1171\u1109\u1175\u1105\u1175\u1109\u1173\u1110\u1173_GIF_En.gif?t=1743334822\" /><br><br>\u300eWho's Next?\u300f is an online social deduction tag game for 4 to 10 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Investigate and chase at the same time, survive until the end, and become the ultimate winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find your soul and identify the one you need to eliminate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/start_en.gif?t=1743334822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All players are connected in a linear tag-like chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/TargetCycle_en.png?t=1743334822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the beginning, you won\u2019t know who your target is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the game, gather information, engage in conversations, and deduce who your target is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather clues by completing tasks</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/task_clue_en.gif?t=1743334822\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discussion phase</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/twilight_en.gif?t=1743334822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you've identified your target, you can attempt to eliminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But be careful!! Attacking the wrong target will backfire and turn against you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/\uc798\ubabb_\ucc98\uce58_YBT.gif?t=1743334822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and eliminate your target to become the last one standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/winner_en.gif?t=1743334822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Korean-inspired, cartoon-style art design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fearful background with goofy and adorable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 20 customizable game options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/setting_en.gif?t=1743334822\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time voice chat support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple game modes and maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse cross-platform play - PC available / Mac, iOS, Android =&gt; Coming in 2025/Q2!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated, expressive character skins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular updates with new content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/opening_anim.gif?t=1743334822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Sinners of the afterlife!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Hurry and kill each other for a chance at reincarnation!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>"