-time voice chat support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple game modes and maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse cross-platform play - PC available / Mac, iOS, Android =&gt; Coming in 2025/Q2!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated, expressive character skins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular updates with new content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/opening_anim.gif?t=1743334822\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Sinners of the afterlife!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Hurry and kill each other for a chance at reincarnation!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["HellAssociation"],"dlc":[3567240],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/header.jpg?t=1743334822","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257065027,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257065027/movie480.mp4?t=1733889306","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257065027/movie_max.mp4?t=1733889306"},"name":"US","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257065027/dd0bc50fcf17d6e86b0f8067f9a9a4908ca673d9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1733889306","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers